<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Bear Sterns cuts Pennzoil-source.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Bear Sterns cuts Pennzoil-source.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Sterns has cut Pennzoil Co to unattractive from neutral because it believes that the board will reject a hostile offer from Union Pacific Resources Group Inc, a source said.</p>
<p>-- No further details were immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Union Pacific last week made an $84 per share cash and stock offer for Pennzoil, a 41 percent premium to the then price of Pennzoil's stock.</p>
<p>-- Pennzoil was trading at 76, down 3/4 from yesterday's close.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsroom 212 859 1902))</p>
</text>
